AltDaemon iOS 17 Rootless Fix 1.0.1
====================================

Purpose
-------
Fixes the reproducible AltDaemon 1.0.1 crash on iOS 17.0-17.3.1 under a rootless
(Dopamine) jailbreak:
EXC_BAD_ACCESS / SIGSEGV at objc_release inside
XPCConnectionHandler.listener(_:shouldAcceptNewConnection:).

This is a rootless port of emp0ry's iOS 17 RootHide fix. The package layout has
been remapped under /var/jb, and the RootHide-only dynamic patch loader hook has
been removed (rootless does not use it).

Changes
-------
The package does not distribute AltDaemon itself. It validates and patches the
already-installed AltDaemon 1.0.1 executable at two ARM64 call sites:

  file offset 0x13DE8: 0D 67 03 94 -> 1F 20 03 D5 (NOP)
  file offset 0x13E38: F9 66 03 94 -> 1F 20 03 D5 (NOP)

A backup is saved at:
/var/mobile/Library/AltDaemonIOS17RootlessFix/AltDaemon-1.0.1.original

The patched binary is re-signed with AltDaemon's required entitlements.
Removing this package restores the backup when available.

Compatibility
-------------
Tested concept ported from iOS 17.3.1 / Relaxin RootHide. Intended for rootless
(Dopamine) environments with AltDaemon 1.0.1 from the alias20 repository.

The patch offsets are specific to the exact AltDaemon 1.0.1 binary. If the
rootless AltDaemon binary differs, apply-fix will refuse to patch and report an
unsupported binary; no changes are made in that case.

No warranty. Use at your own risk.
